# Why and because in Russian: потому что
subtitle: "Tom has news: a job in Petersburg. Ask why with почему́, answer with потому́ что, and draw the result with поэ́тому."
tags: ["russian","because in russian","потому что","почему","russian grammar"]
teaches: ["grammar/linking-words"]
thumb: "band \"Why and because in Russian\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Packing in Russian: все эти вещи","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/102-russian-packing.cast"}

