      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Я переезжа́ю, поэ́тому я учу́ ру́сский.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3720
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:4oewi1'
    '|b||Сего́дня хо́лодно, поэ́тому я до́ма.':
