      ms: 3200
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:rjxo29'
    '|b||Я до́ма, потому́ что сего́дня хо́лодно.':
