      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:1ji3ode'
    '|a||Six questions now, then your score. Someone asks: Почему́ ты не на рабо́те? Вы́берите the answer.':
