      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:f7guk4'
    '|a||Пра́вильно! Потому́ что answers почему́.':
